  ['Clear communication, sharp ideas and a launch that landed exactly on schedule.', 'Lucas Parker', 'Marketing Director'],
  ['They understood our vision instantly and turned it into a site customers love.', 'Liam Foster', 'CEO'],
  ['Every detail was thoughtfully considered. We finally have work we are proud of.', 'Noah Bennett', 'Business Owner'],
  ['Working together felt seamless, and every creative choice had a clear reason.', 'Kenji Sato', 'Co-Founder'],
  ['Their campaign strategy grew our audience faster than any agency before them.', 'Oliver Grant', 'Digital Marketing Manager'],
